=== POST /bank/statement/import ===
Summary: Upload bank statement file.
Consumes: None
  Param: bankId (query, required=True)
    Schema: {'type': 'integer', 'format': 'int64'}
  Param: accountId (query, required=True)
    Schema: {'type': 'integer', 'format': 'int64'}
  Param: fromDate (query, required=True)
    Schema: {'type': 'string'}
  Param: toDate (query, required=True)
    Schema: {'type': 'string'}
  Param: externalId (query, required=None)
    Schema: {'type': 'string'}
  Param: fileFormat (query, required=True)
    Schema: {'type': 'string', 'enum': ['DNB_CSV', 'EIKA_TELEPAY', 'SPAREBANK1_TELEPAY', 'VISMA_ACCOUNT_STATEMENT', 'HANDELSBANKEN_TELEPAY', 'SPAREBANKEN_VEST_TELEPAY', 'NORDEA_CSV', 'TRANSFERWISE', 'SPAREBANKEN_SOR_TELEPAY', 'SPAREBANKEN_OST_TELEPAY', 'DANSKE_BANK_CSV', 'CULTURA_BANK_TELEPAY', 'SBANKEN_PRIVAT_CSV', 'HAUGESUND_SPAREBANK_CSV', 'VISMA_ACCOUNT_STATEMENT_PSD2', 'SBANKEN_BEDRIFT_CSV', 'LANDKREDITT_TELEPAY', 'ZTL', 'VISMA_ACCOUNT_STATEMENT_PLATFORM_AGNOSTIC', 'VISMA_ACCOUNT_STATEMENT_PDS2_PLATFORM_AGNOSTIC']}

=== POST /bank/reconciliation ===
Summary: Post a bank reconciliation.

=== POST /bank/reconciliation/match ===
Summary: Create a bank reconciliation match.

